{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 0, "text": "// Player thinks + Make coffee"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 1, "text": "看来我一个人是过不去了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 2, "text": "希望这里的米塔不会咬人…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 3, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 4, "text": "我到底在浪费什么时间呢…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 5, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 8, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 9, "text": "// Player tries to wake up MitaDreamer"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 10, "text": "米塔？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 11, "text": "米塔，醒醒。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 12, "text": "米-塔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 14, "text": "米塔，醒醒。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 15, "text": "我需要你的帮助。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 17, "text": "你是谁啊？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 19, "text": "帮我拉一下拉杆。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 21, "text": "什么拉杆？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 22, "text": "让我睡会儿…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 23, "text": "或者帮我冲杯咖啡。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 25, "text": "你只要走两步路就到了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 26, "text": "米塔？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 27, "text": "米-塔！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 28, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 31, "text": "// Player gives away the coffee"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 32, "text": "米塔，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 33, "text": "这是给你的咖啡。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 34, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 37, "text": "// MitaDreamer exercise"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 38, "text": "你刚刚说"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 39, "text": "拉杆？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 41, "text": "对。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 43, "text": "你是怎么知道的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 44, "text": "不过，我为什么要问呢…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 45, "text": "你都已经在这里了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 46, "text": "就说明你已经知道很多事了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 47, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 48, "text": "等等，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 49, "text": "我要坐一会儿。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 51, "text": "然后呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 53, "text": "我不知道该跟你说什么。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 54, "text": "但我需要继续前进。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 55, "text": "沿着戒指指引的路线..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 56, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 57, "text": "她的戒指在你那儿吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 58, "text": "难怪，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 59, "text": "你能来到这里…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 60, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 61, "text": "没错。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 62, "text": "所以你会帮我吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 63, "text": "帮我拉一下拉杆？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 64, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 65, "text": "当然了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 66, "text": "我会帮你…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 67, "text": "拉拉杆…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 69, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 70, "text": "米塔，又睡着了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 71, "text": "我们快走吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 72, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 73, "text": "啊？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 74, "text": "好的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 75, "text": "我们走吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 78, "text": "// MitaDreamer fall"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 79, "text": "快醒醒。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 80, "text": "你有那么困吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 81, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 82, "text": "// MitaDreamer again sleep"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 83, "text": "快醒醒。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 84, "text": "我们已经到了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 85, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 87, "text": "// Switches"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 88, "text": "好，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 89, "text": "我准备好了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 90, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 91, "text": "我也准备好了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 92, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 93, "text": "嗯…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 94, "text": "我开始"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 95, "text": "倒计时"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 96, "text": "然后我们一起拉动拉杆。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 97, "text": "明-白-了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 98, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 99, "text": "你只要别睡着了就行，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 100, "text": "开始倒计时吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 103, "text": "3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 104, "text": "2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 105, "text": "1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 106, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 107, "text": "// Player lose 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 108, "text": "你在搞什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 109, "text": "嗯，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 110, "text": "再来一次吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 112, "text": "// Player lose 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 113, "text": "再来一次？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 114, "text": "还差一点点"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 115, "text": "我快要"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 116, "text": "睡着了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 118, "text": "// Player lose 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 119, "text": "我快要睡着了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 120, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 122, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 123, "text": "太好了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 124, "text": "谢谢你，米塔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 125, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 126, "text": "嗯呼"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 129, "text": "怎么"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 130, "text": "这么慢"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 131, "text": "这扇大门"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 132, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 134, "text": "我要去睡觉了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 136, "text": "// Why kitchen?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 137, "text": "我们到这里来干什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 138, "text": "我要是在冰冷的厨房地板上睡着了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 139, "text": "那都是你的错。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 141, "text": "// Why bathroom?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 142, "text": "我不明白…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 143, "text": "你要在这里拉什么拉杆？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 144, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 145, "text": "// Put button"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 146, "text": "什么事情都没发生？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 147, "text": "那这个按钮有什么用？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 149, "text": "// Cofee"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 150, "text": "要不要再喝点咖啡？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 151, "text": "不然你又睡着了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 152, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 153, "text": "什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 154, "text": "没什么…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 155, "text": "这杯咖啡的味道很可怕…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 156, "text": "我没事…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 157, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 158, "text": "// Button"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 159, "text": "米塔？按钮失灵了，你能听到吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 160, "text": "你在听吗？"}
